            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Nishitsugu",
            "review_text": "masa\nShibuya, Japan244 contributions\n0\nReal Edomae sushi 🍣\nOct 2025 • Couples\nI didn’t think I could taste such authentic sushi in Ho Chi Minh City!\nThe owner, Saitane, is a skilled sushi chef with about 30 years of experience.\nIn Ebisu, Tokyo, a famous restaurant without a sign used to be frequented by celebrities and celebrities 🍣\n\nThe style is the same in Ho Chi Minh City: a hideaway with no sign at the entrance.\nOnce inside, sophisticated counters and calm lighting spread out, making it a truly “famous restaurant”.\n\nWe are also thoroughly particular about the aging and preparation of fish,\nI don't think there is any other restaurant in Vietnam where you can taste such delicate aged sushi.\n\nI felt the craftsmanship and philosophy of the craftsmen in a consistent manner that maximizes the flavor of the ingredients.\nThis is one of the places you should definitely visit on a special night.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten October 30, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
