            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Nishitsugu",
            "review_text": "Thanh Thanh\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nOMAKASE SUSHI NISHITSUGU EXPERIENCE\nSep 2023 • Couples\nIf people are looking for a quiet, luxurious Omakase experience, Sushi Nishitsugu is a place you should not miss.\n\nIngredients at the restaurant are imported directly from Japan every day to ensure the restaurant's freshness. The ingredients here are very high quality and carefully selected by the chef. Not only can you eat delicious food but you can also watch the chefs work live until the dish comes out 😝\n\nMy first experience at omakase Sushi Nishitsugu and it's definitely worth the experience!!!\n\n10/10 must try must go 🦞🦞🦞\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten September 8, 2023",
