            "review_text": "チビちゃん〜\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam11 contributions\n0\nEAT SUSHI NISHITSUGU TOGETHER\nAug 2023 • Friends\nThings I love about this restaurant\n1. Having a secret door using a password is a very interesting experience\n2. The restaurant space is quiet\n3. Enthusiastic service\n4. The chef is Japanese, very dedicated, friendly, and very sociable (although he doesn't speak much Vietnamese).\n5. I highly recommend the dishes here (my set was 3 million VND)\nEspecially the minidon dish (with sea urchin and abalone sauce served with salmon eggs) is delicious\nThe most consistent special dish is hand-rolled sushi.\nI really like ! (It's so delicious that I don't have a photo)\n6. For me, my favorite yuzu ice cream is sour2 sweet2 super sticky!\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten August 21, 2023",
